d destroying  parodies  these mainland aldians are hoping beyond  hope that if they demonstrate their  loyalty towards their own oppressors by  supporting the destruction of their  fellow aliens on the island  they will finally be shown some mercy by  the marlenes  over the course of the past 100 years  the marlans in particular have instilled  such extreme self-hatred into the hearts  of the aldians  that they have internalized the very  racism and oppression that they have  been subject to  for at least a hundred years aaron's  half-brother zeke  is the perfect embodiment of this very  thing  zeke is an aldian who grew up on the  continent and he was so victimized by  marlene oppression that he came to  believe that the only way to save the  world  was to bring about the end of his own  people tragically  the aldians like zeke who suffered for  their entire lives at the hands of the  marlene oppressors  started hating themselves to such an  extent that they decided to do exactly  what the merlions wanted  they decided to destroy their own people  but not aaron when he came to understand  that no peaceful solution was possible  and that no matter what happens the  outside world would keep attacking  parodies until every alden on the island  was dead  aaron refused to lie down and take it  since there is no hope for peace only  two options remain  aaron can either sit back and allow  everyone he ever knew and cared about on  the island to be destroyed by invaders  from the outside world  or he can fight back and destroy the  outside world  to such an extent that no invader will  ever be able to threaten parodies again  aaron of course  chooses the latter option he decides to  destroy the outside world  before the outside world can destroy  parodies  in order to execute this plan aaron is  forced to reject his closest friends  including armin and mikasa and he is  forced to betray his half-brother zeke  he even uses the attack titan's ability  to pass down future memories  to ensure that his plan comes to  fruition in fact  we eventually learned that when grisha  was having second thoughts about killing  the rhys family and capturing the  founding titan power  it was actually aaron from the future  who convinced grisha to go  through with his plan and according to  what grisha says to future zeke  after he consumes the founding titan  power he has seen even more awareness  future memories  and they are absolutely terrifying aaron  was the one who yearned to be free since  birth  aaron was the one who refused to sit  back and allow his people to be  punished for the sins of their ancestors  and aaron was the one who willingly  decided to initiate  the rumbling for 100 years the outside  world has feared the rumbling  king carl fritz the king who had built  the walls in the first place  threatened the outside world not to  interfere in the affairs of the island  he created the walls and he filled them  with millions of colossal titans as a  deterrent  he said that if forces from the outside  world ever did attack parodies  the millions of colossal titans would be  released and the entire world would be  flattened  during an apocalyptic event known as the  rumbling  however the outside world and marlei in  particular  did not get the message instead of  avoiding the island for fear of the  rumbling  they kept plotting new attacks in order  to take the founding titan power and  remove the threat of the rumbling from  the equation  altogether instead of deterring foreign  nations from interfering in the affairs  of the island  the rumbling is part of the reason why  the outside world was so intent on  attacking parodies  ironically the outside world's  determination to prevent the rumbling  is the very thing that makes the  rumbling inevitable  because as we know aaron decides that  the only way to save the island  is to use the rumbling to destroy  everything else  after making a deal with emir fritz the  original founding titan  a